    "body": "**Main is red:** `structural::shell_structure_dark` and `_light` fail. They expected `v0.15.0 · test`, but tests pin the toolbar version (#449/#450), and today's wider ribbon makes the shell paint the compact `v0.0.0` alone.\n\n**Fix:** the expected version comes from `build_info::toolbar_version()`, the same source the toolbar uses, and either label form (full or compact) is accepted.\n\n**Gate:** `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib -- structural`: 3 passed. `clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -D warnings`: clean.\n\nChangelog: none (test-only)\n\nFixes #556\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
